    {
      "text": "5. **What is different types of joins in Spark?**\n  - Ans: broadcastJoin(one small and large join), shuffle sort-merge-join(two large table), shuffle-hash-join(1 medium size and 1 large table)\n  - Ans: left, right, inner, cross, self, left-anti, left-semi\n\n6. **Why count when used with group by is a transformation else it's an action?**\n- Ans: running count on group by which o/p Relationaldataset causes to aggregate , but count on the dataset ",
