    {
      "text": "###Spark Dynamic Resource Allocation Executor Timeout\n\nspark.dynamicAllocation.executorIdleTimeout = 60    (default)\n\n\n- Basically when you enable Dynamic allocation it gracefully remove the Idle containers which were idle for (60s as default) But when you lower the value will remove the executors frequently depending upon the executor's usage (just like the tasks getting allocated to those executors and the amount of tasks required)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "a4459e3db0054c17b19b0"
